@startuml
title UC-02 Store New Credential - analysis sequence diagram

actor ":AccountHolder" as AH
participant ":CredentialController" as CC <<control>>
participant ":Vault" as V
participant ":Credential" as C

AH -> CC : 1 submits the service, username and password
CC -> CC : 2 checks that every required detail is present

alt A1: a required detail is missing
  CC --> AH : 2a names the missing detail and keeps what was entered
end

CC -> V : 3 asks whether the vault is unlocked

alt vault is unlocked
  V --> CC : 4 reports the vault is unlocked
else A5: vault has locked from inactivity
  V --> CC : 4a reports the vault is locked
  CC --> AH : 4b asks the account holder to unlock before saving
end

CC -> V : 5 asks whether a credential exists for this service and username

alt no matching credential
  V --> CC : 6 reports no matching credential
else A4: duplicate entry
  V --> CC : 6a reports a matching credential
  CC --> AH : 6b shows the existing credential and asks whether to replace it or cancel
end

create C
CC -> C : 7 creates the credential from the entered details
CC -> V : 8 asks the vault to add the credential

alt saved
  V --> CC : 9 confirms the credential is stored
  CC --> AH : 10 confirms the save and shows the credential in the list
else A2: saving fails
  V --> CC : 9a reports the credential could not be stored
  CC --> AH : 9b tells the account holder nothing was saved and to re-enter the details
end

@enduml
